# A merged PR shows, under "Merged", how the checks went on the commit the merge made on its
# base branch; a failed CircleCI job there is offered under Conversation.
wait settled
open tamarinworks/porter#1522
wait settled
wait until #merge-commit-checks
expect #merge-commit-checks has label "Checks on master: 1 of 3 checks failed"
snap merge-commit-checks
snap header-merged
click button ~"CircleCI"
wait until button "typecheck" in #circleci-pane
